# score: Gigante y juguete
# summary: 11 bars / 2 guitars / ~0.4 min — one tune in canon on two guitar-shaped worlds four octaves apart: a giant tuned an octave down, a toy a fourth up (a requinto)
# tempo: 92    time: 4/4    key: Em    bars: 11
# reverb: 1.2
# master: rms=-17

# text @b1: the toy (tuned A2 D3 G3 C4 E4 A4) plays the tune where it is written
# text @b2: one bar later the giant (tuned E1 A1 D2 G2 B2 E3) plays it two octaves below; same anatomy, same body, strings at other tensions

